	(text "MDBT50Q-1MV2 (nRF52840). Pads 3..14 are 'standard drive, low frequency I/O only' (Raytac spec 2.6): they carry the\nencoder and the MUX select / inhibit lines (change once per column, well under 10 kHz) and the ADC input (AIN4).\nRow strobes are on unrestricted pads; PURGE (P1.02) only ever sees the millivolt-level SENSE node.  P0.15 (boot loader LED), NFC pins and P0.26/P0.27 (next to XL1/XL2) are unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.00 58.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "b4bd414c-1b84-5e33-8b10-3e2b7515bca4")
	)
