	(text "BQ24072: USB100 fixed (EN1 = EN2 = CE = TD = GND), ISET 8.2k, ILIM 1.5k, TS 10k, TMR open.  OUT -> VDDH.\nQ1 = battery reverse-polarity protection (drain to the connector, source to BAT, gate to GND).  J3: 1 = BAT+, 2 = GND"
